data modify storage pnp:cards mio set value {furnace:"Furnace: takes ore, logs, or raw food with coal. Makes ingots, coal, or cooked food.",barrel:"Barrel: takes one kind of card, up to 128, and passes it out of its outputs.",hopper:"Hopper: takes cards and passes them on. Drop one card on it to filter.",autocrafter:"Autocrafter: crafts the card it is set to from what it is fed. 4 inputs, 4 outputs.",dropper:"Dropper: takes cards and hands them out across its outputs.",sell_box:"Sell box: takes cards and sells them. Emeralds come out of its output.",bundle:"Bundle: takes cards and sends them to your inventory.",oak_tree:"Oak Tree: makes Oak Logs, apples, and sticks while a villager works it.",rock:"Rock: makes Cobblestone, coal, and iron ore while a villager works it.",berry_bush:"Berry Bush: makes Sweet Berries while a villager works it.",farm:"Farm: makes Wheat while a villager works it.",forest:"Forest: a villager exploring it sends out what they find.",mountain:"Mountain: a villager exploring it sends out ore, stone, and more.",cave:"Cave: a villager with a pickaxe and torch sends out ore and treasure.",sheep:"Sheep: makes Wool while a villager tends it.",cow:"Cow: makes Leather while a villager tends it.",chicken:"Chicken: makes Eggs while a villager tends it.",pig:"Pig: makes Porkchops while a villager tends it."}
data modify storage pnp:cards mio.copper_barrel set value "Copper Barrel: takes one kind of card, up to 256, and passes it out of its outputs."
